You cannot optimise some games because they're doing a lot of calculations and needs the resources. We'll always have lightweight games, but the proper leading edge of graphics will always need enhancements to be playable at high framerates, otherwise it wouldn't be the leading edge.

This is also not me saying that all games are well optimised right now, they clearly aren't, but this tech gives us opportunities in decently optimised games.

